## Plenary and Breakout: AV That Matches Your Conference Format

A conference plenary needs sound and a screen that reach every seat in the main hall, usually paired with a lectern microphone for speakers. A breakout session needs its own smaller, self contained sound and projection setup, running in parallel without interfering with the room next door.

Our [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) is built for the plenary: a 60 inch LED display, active PA sound reinforcement and a technician on site for up to six hours. For a smaller breakout room or executive session, the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) covers up to 40 guests without the full technician package.

For our full audio visual rental range, see the [audio visual rental page](/blog/audio-visual-rental/).

