## Testimonials

### Why Audio Visual Quality Matters at a Conference

If a delegate in the back row cannot hear the plenary speaker, or the projector drops mid presentation, that is what the audience remembers, not the content. Reliable sound and a technician who can fix a problem before the room notices is what a conference actually needs from its AV supplier.

