## How This Differs from a Corporate Event or Press Conference

A conference AV setup is not the same as a single-room corporate event or a press conference. A [corporate event](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-corporate-events/) is usually one room, one agenda, one setup. A [press conference](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-press-conferences/) is built around one speaker area, a podium mic and space for press cameras.

A conference is the more demanding case: a plenary session running alongside one or more breakout rooms, each needing its own sound and screen, on the same schedule. That is what our MICE and Basic MICE packages are built to combine.

